      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's a good start. I noticed you tied the luxury persona to a \"Western-centric, Euro-American\" background while the budget persona has a different vibe. Can you dig a bit deeper into why those specific cultural backgrounds fit those economic levels? I want to make sure our ad imagery and localized messaging really hit the mark for each group's specific traditions or community values.",
      "source": "evaluator"
